-   * <li><tt>k&lt;0</tt>: <tt>0</tt>.</li>
-   * <li><tt>k==0 || k==n</tt>: <tt>1</tt>.</li>
-   * <li><tt>k==1 || k==n-1</tt>: <tt>n</tt>.</li>
-   * <li>else: <tt>(n * n-1 * ... * n-k+1 ) / ( 1 * 2 * ... * k )</tt>.</li>
-   * </ul>
-   *
-   * @return the binomial coefficient.
-   */
-  public static double binomial(long n, long k) {
-    if (k < 0) {
-      return 0;
-    }
-    if (k == 0 || k == n) {
-      return 1;
-    }
-    if (k == 1 || k == n - 1) {
-      return n;
-    }
